    "MacClipboard 偏好设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacClipboard Preferences"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacClipboard 需要辅助功能权限以自动触发 Cmd+V 粘贴。请在【系统设置 -> 隐私与安全性 -> 辅助功能】中允许 MacClipboard。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacClipboard needs Accessibility permission to simulate Cmd+V for pasting. Please allow it in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Accessibility."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘C 复制  |  ⌘P 置顶  |  ⌘⌫ 删除  |  ⌘, 设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘C Copy  |  ⌘P Pin  |  ⌘⌫ Delete  |  ⌘, Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如: com.apple.Terminal, com.googlecode.iterm2": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. com.apple.Terminal, com.googlecode.iterm2"
