        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System Permissions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "缺失辅助功能权限时，无法自动模拟 Cmd+V 粘贴。请在系统设置中允许。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without Accessibility permission, auto-paste via Cmd+V is unavailable. Please allow it in System Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
