      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Details"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "超出上限后将自动淘汰最旧的记录。被【置顶】的卡片不会被淘汰。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oldest records are removed beyond the limit. Pinned items are never removed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
